{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1760491805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras_big/c0c5416ae62dabc288e5d017646cd4af.avif?t=1760491805 width=800 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mal\u00f3n</strong> is an indie <strong>tower defense</strong> game with a <strong>top-down view</strong> that combines elements of <strong>strategy and skill</strong>: victory depends as much on your strategic insight as on your dexterity in controlling your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Mal\u00f3n</strong>, you\u2019ll manage a frontier army outpost, taking on the responsibility of defending it at all costs. To succeed, you\u2019ll need to grow your economy, expand your base, and train soldiers to fight by your side in defense of the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1760491805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras_big/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1760491805 width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>The game unfolds through day and night cycles:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the day \u2014 when strategy takes center stage \u2014 you\u2019ll have to think carefully about how to invest your coins, because once night falls, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/77cf5b3eb480aaa6f9a8eafdbe19dcd7.poster.avif?t=1760491805\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/77cf5b3eb480aaa6f9a8eafdbe19dcd7.webm?t=1760491805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/77cf5b3eb480aaa6f9a8eafdbe19dcd7.mp4?t=1760491805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the dark hours, you'll have to fight with whatever you've got. The worse your decisions were during the day, the more you\u2019ll need to make up for them with your skill at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/061e1dfc4fdc2cc77540be06afb6e55a.poster.avif?t=1760491805\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/061e1dfc4fdc2cc77540be06afb6e55a.webm?t=1760491805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/061e1dfc4fdc2cc77540be06afb6e55a.mp4?t=1760491805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462960/extras/680d1f13961bb51c600197d17fb70b34.avif?t=1760491805\" data-big-src=https:/